Z||000000||Coop88||08-19-2000||12:19 PM||||Hi everyone. I was just wondering if there was really any improvement in an aftermarket ignition coil compared to the original. I really don't know if one is better than the other. I was thinking about an Accel ignition coil for my car. What do you think?||||reg||5
Z||000001||GT Bastard||08-19-2000||01:53 PM||||Go MSD.... I've heard many many bad things about Accel coils.  Not to say that they're all true of course.||||reg||1
